From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 04:06:56 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 43/44] ui-egui: the simplified Sheets toolbar, one row of Fluent
 icons drawn instead of the ribbon

A new office_toolbar.rs draws the row (font, alignment, number, cells, data, view, output groups, width-aware, with a
Full ribbon / Simple ribbon toggle that writes the shared settings.toml). ribbon.rs shares its pickers and keytip helpers
(pub(crate)); lib.rs has the one call-site line; the apps call office_toolbar::init() at start. Icons are alpha masks in
office_icons.bin. Without the overlay or before init() upstream's ribbon is drawn.
